    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7163" root="حجر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجْرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>An enclosure</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَظِيرَةٌ</span>) <i>for camels.</i> (S,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And hence,] The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجْرَة</span> of a house; (S;)
[i. e.] <i>a chamber</i> [in an absolute sense, and so in
the present day]; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْتٌ</span>: (Msb:) or <i>an upper
chamber;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرْفَةٌ</span>: (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجَرٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجُرَاتٌ</span>
(S, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجَرَاتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجْرَاتٌ</span>. (Z, Msb,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجْرَةٌ</span>.

